Source-files
------------
main.c          - Command line handling, capture setup and the per-packet callbacks
dhcpdump.c      - Frame decapsulation, the text and JSON packet decoders
dhcpdump.h      - Interface of dhcpdump.c
dhcp_options.h  - Tables with dhcp-packet-field values, their readable descriptions and value types
json.c          - Small streaming JSON writer used by -j
json.h          - Interface of json.c
dhcp.c          - DHCP message parser used by the session tracker
dhcp.h          - Interface of dhcp.c
session.c       - Session and transaction tracking for the TUI
session.h       - Interface of session.c
tui.c           - The interactive TUI (-t)
tui.h           - Interface of tui.c
version.h       - Current program version
dhcpdump.pod    - The man page source
Makefile        - Simple build system

Tests
-----
tests/run.sh    - Regression test driver (make test)
tests/mkpcap.c  - Generator of the test captures
tests/jsoncheck.c - Strict checker of the -j output
tests/expected/ - Expected output of the decoders
